<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16556" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄστομ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>speechless,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				76
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>Epict.</u>
				2.24.26
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄ. πεποιηκέναι</span> reduce to
				<i>silence,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Luc.
			</span></i>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λεχ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					15
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>with no mouth,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄ. καὶ ἄρρινες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					2.1.9
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.938c
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				940b
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>with no outlet,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λίμνη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					7.3.15
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> of horses,
				<i>hard-mouthed,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>El.</u>
				724
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Art.</u>
				9
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> of dogs,
				<i>soft-mouthed, unable to hold with the teeth,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyn.</u>
				3.3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b> of meat and
			drink, <i>unpalatable,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hices.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				7.323a
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				1.110
			</span></i>, al.: 
				Comp.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				1.95
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>V.</b> of metal,
				<i>soft, incapable of a fine edge,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Lys.</u>
				17
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
